codex
Two defects are confirmed: C3MG omits `coordinate_descent_tuning=True` from PyTorch 2.8’s max-autotune preset, and the shared reducer reads `clocks_session3.csv` for session 4, bypassing its drift exclusions. I found a local PyTorch 2.8 installation and will use it to check cache separation more directly.
